			<dict>
				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Card Skill - run any scrape-collection skill (or open a project) by voice or tap. Run it empty (Hey Siri, Card Skill / Home Screen / widget) and it pulls a LIVE menu from n8server over SSH - every skill, then every project - and runs whatever you tap. The menu is always current, so brand-new skills appear automatically. If the shortcut is triggered WITH input text, that text is sent verbatim instead of showing the menu.</string>
